      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "今天不用走很远，边走边拍就好。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc043_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我对摄影其实不太懂。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc043_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "没关系，我也不是专业的。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc043_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "那你拍照最注意什么？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc043_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "光线，还有画面里什么最重要。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc043_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "不是先看设备吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc043_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "设备有帮助，但不是第一件事。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc043_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "那用手机也可以拍得不错。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc043_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "当然。先学会观察更重要。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc043_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "比如这棵树和后面的湖？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc043_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "对，你可以换一个位置看看。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc043_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "走两步以后画面真的不一样。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc043_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "摄影会让人更认真地看周围。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc043_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这跟我学中文有点儿像。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc043_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "怎么说？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc043_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "以前很多细节我都没注意，现在会听得更仔细。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc043_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "那今天就练习认真看。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc043_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "好，不追求拍很多，拍几张喜欢的就行。",
      "emotion": "natural"
